# SignalHub APIs — reproducible demo requests
# Use with VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, or curl.
# Prerequisites: API running on :8000 with seeded sources.
#
#   cd apps/api
#   python ../../scripts/seed.py
#   uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = {{$dotenv TRIGGER_API_KEY}}

### 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. List sources (contracts + freshness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources

### 3. Source detail (runs, signals, QC scoped to source)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources/open-meteo

### 4. Metrics summary (ops KPIs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/metrics/summary

### 5. Recent runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs?limit=10

### 6. Freshness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/freshness

### 7. Quality checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quality?source=open-meteo&limit=20

### 8. Normalized signals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signals?source=open-meteo&limit=20

### 9. Trigger ingestion (omit X-API-Key if TRIGGER_API_KEY is empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/trigger/open-meteo
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. OpenAPI JSON (machine-readable contract)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
